{"id":"5fda4571139fdbc0","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point.md","title":"有限程序信息迭代的显式稳定界","display":"thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point — 有限程序信息迭代的显式稳定界","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point","aliases":["72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point"],"display":"thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point — 有限程序信息迭代的显式稳定界","depends_on":["[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]]"],"chapter":"IX","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.IX §§3.3,4.2, print653,658/PDF665,670; local finite-lattice consequence","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked","proof_status":"local argument checked; not machine checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"created":"2026-10-22","revision_round":"2026-10-22-expansion","review_2026_10_22_deep":"利用lower闭合把有限ground稳定界从2|H|加强为|H|"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point — 有限程序信息迭代的显式稳定界"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"dd6da9fb2b3060fc\" href=\"?note=dd6da9fb2b3060fc\" title=\"72-df-finite-ground-program-operator\">72-df-finite-ground-program-operator</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"IX"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.IX §§3.3,4.2, print653,658/PDF665,670; local finite-lattice consequence"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-local-contract-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"local argument checked; not machine checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-22"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"2026-10-22-expansion"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"利用lower闭合把有限ground稳定界从2|H|加强为|H|"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>H、P、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_P\">\\(\\mathcal T_P\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"dd6da9fb2b3060fc\" href=\"?note=dd6da9fb2b3060fc\" title=\"72-df-finite-ground-program-operator\">72-df-finite-ground-program-operator</a>；I、J 的次序逐 H 坐标比较；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_n\">\\(I_n\\)</span> 在下式递归，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N:=2|H|\">\\(N:=2|H|\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"I_0:=\\{\\langle A,\\mathsf u\\rangle:A\\in H\\},\\qquad I_{n+1}:=\\mathcal T_P(I_n).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[I_0:=\\{\\langle A,\\mathsf u\\rangle:A\\in H\\},\\qquad I_{n+1}:=\\mathcal T_P(I_n).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (I_n\\sqsubseteq I_{n+1}),\\qquad\\mathcal T_P(I_N)=I_N.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (I_n\\sqsubseteq I_{n+1}),\\qquad\\mathcal T_P(I_N)=I_N.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall J\\in\\mathsf{Four}^H\\ (\\mathcal T_P(J)\\sqsubseteq J\\Rightarrow I_N\\sqsubseteq J).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall J\\in\\mathsf{Four}^H\\ (\\mathcal T_P(J)\\sqsubseteq J\\Rightarrow I_N\\sqsubseteq J).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\forall A\\in H\\quad I_n(A)\\ne\\mathsf c.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\forall A\\in H\\quad I_n(A)\\ne\\mathsf c.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_P(I_{|H|})=I_{|H|}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal T_P(I_{|H|})=I_{|H|}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>逻辑四值运算均对信息次序单调，故算子单调；底到第一步以及归纳给递增链。H 上共有 2|H| 个布尔信息坐标，每次严格增长至少把一个0变1，且从不变回。若前 N 次全严格，则已无可增加的坐标；若更早相等，确定的迭代随后恒定。因此 N 阶段已经不动。对任意前不动点 J，从底逐步归纳 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I_n\\sqsubseteq J\">\\(I_n\\sqsubseteq J\\)</span>，得到最小性。该有限界不适用于有函数符号、无限 Herbrand 基的原书一般程序。</p>\n<p>本轮深审：每个逻辑四值运算及否定都保持 lower={u,t,f}，空合取/析取的单位也在 lower 中，故逐步迭代不会产生 c。在递增 lower 链上，每个原子只能从 u 变为 t 或 f 一次，故严格增长至多 |H| 次。原 2|H| 的一般布尔坐标界仍正确，此处给出利用本算子一致性保持的更精确界；H为空时第0阶段已稳定。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-finite-ground-program-operator","status":"resolved","id":"dd6da9fb2b3060fc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-finite-ground-program-operator","status":"resolved","id":"dd6da9fb2b3060fc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"H、P、$\\mathcal T_P$ 取 [[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]]；I、J 的次序逐 H 坐标比较；$n\\in\\omega$。$I_n$ 在下式递归，$N:=2|H|$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T_P","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"I_n","display":false},{"tex":"N:=2|H|","display":false},{"tex":"I_0:=\\{\\langle A,\\mathsf u\\rangle:A\\in H\\},\\qquad I_{n+1}:=\\mathcal T_P(I_n).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ (I_n\\sqsubseteq I_{n+1}),\\qquad\\mathcal T_P(I_N)=I_N.","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall J\\in\\mathsf{Four}^H\\ (\\mathcal T_P(J)\\sqsubseteq J\\Rightarrow I_N\\sqsubseteq J).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\forall A\\in H\\quad I_n(A)\\ne\\mathsf c.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_P(I_{|H|})=I_{|H|}.","display":true},{"tex":"I_n\\sqsubseteq J","display":false}],"bytes":2439,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-181","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-composition]] · [[72-thm-finite-ground-information-fixed-point]] · [[72-thm-first-order-unification]] · [[72-thm-sld-answer-soundness]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-555","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"IX章新增13项：[[72-df-finite-ground-program-operator]] · [[72-df-logic-program-substitution]] · [[72-df-sld-refutation-answer]] · [[72-df-sld-resolution-step]] · [[72-df-sldnf-abstract-success-failure]] · [[72-df-sldnf-safe-pair]] · [[72-df-unifier-most-general-unifier]] · [[72-ex-ground-goal-may-be-unsafe]] · [[72-ex-ground-negative-loop-information]] · [[72-lem-program-substitution-comp